title: "2SDIF: A Serverless Dual Channel Oracle for Data in Transit Integrity in Blockchain Enabled Fog IoT Systems"
abstract: "Prototype and raw measurements of 2SDIF, an accountable fog oracle: an HMAC-authenticated digest goes to a serverless witness, and the smart contract verifies the witness attestation."
